{"id":"de2483770532ad4a","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-zfc-topo9-dyadic-compactum.md","title":"ZFC Topo9 Dyadic Compactum","display":"df-zfc-topo9-dyadic-compactum — ZFC Topo9 Dyadic Compactum","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-topo9-dyadic-compactum","aliases":["58-df-zfc-topo9-dyadic-compactum"],"display":"df-zfc-topo9-dyadic-compactum — ZFC Topo9 Dyadic Compactum","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-topo8-compact-hausdorff-space]]","[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-topo11-continuous-image-set]]","[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-topo9-dyadic-compactum"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-topo9-dyadic-compactum</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-topo9-dyadic-compactum — ZFC Topo9 Dyadic Compactum"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3639c3f839b6c954\" href=\"?note=3639c3f839b6c954\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-zfc-topo8-compact-hausdorff-space\">../batch06/58-df-zfc-topo8-compact-hausdorff-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"31e075a848427dc9\" href=\"?note=31e075a848427dc9\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-zfc-topo11-continuous-image-set\">../batch05/58-df-zfc-topo11-continuous-image-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5260a5349d0b732f\" href=\"?note=5260a5349d0b732f\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology\">../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau\\in V\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(2=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> carries its discrete topology <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(2)\">\\(\\mathcal P(2)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11ContinuousImageSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11ContinuousImageSet}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8CompactHausdorffSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8CompactHausdorffSpace}_S\\)</span> are the registered upstream predicates.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9DyadicCompactum}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9DyadicCompactum}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo9\\text{-}dyadic\\text{-}compactum}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9DyadicCompactum}_S(X,\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8CompactHausdorffSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land\n\\exists\\kappa,\\vec X_2,\\vec\\tau_2,\\tau_2,f\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\n\\forall i\\in\\kappa\\;(\\vec X_2(i)=2\\land\\vec\\tau_2(i)=\\mathcal P(2))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{11em}\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S(\\kappa,\\vec X_2,\\vec\\tau_2,2^\\kappa,\\tau_2)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11ContinuousImageSet}_S(X,f,2^\\kappa,\\tau_2,X,\\tau)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo9\\text{-}dyadic\\text{-}compactum}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9DyadicCompactum}_S(X,\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8CompactHausdorffSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land\n\\exists\\kappa,\\vec X_2,\\vec\\tau_2,\\tau_2,f\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\n\\forall i\\in\\kappa\\;(\\vec X_2(i)=2\\land\\vec\\tau_2(i)=\\mathcal P(2))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{11em}\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S(\\kappa,\\vec X_2,\\vec\\tau_2,2^\\kappa,\\tau_2)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11ContinuousImageSet}_S(X,f,2^\\kappa,\\tau_2,X,\\tau)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A dyadic compactum is a compact Hausdorff space that is a continuous image of a Cantor cube; both source and target topologies are explicit.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-zfc-topo8-compact-hausdorff-space","status":"resolved","id":"3639c3f839b6c954","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-topo8-compact-hausdorff-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-zfc-topo11-continuous-image-set","status":"resolved","id":"31e075a848427dc9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-topo11-continuous-image-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology","status":"resolved","id":"5260a5349d0b732f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\tau\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"2=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(2)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11ContinuousImageSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8CompactHausdorffSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9DyadicCompactum}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo9\\text{-}dyadic\\text{-}compactum}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9DyadicCompactum}_S(X,\\tau)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8CompactHausdorffSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land\n\\exists\\kappa,\\vec X_2,\\vec\\tau_2,\\tau_2,f\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\n\\forall i\\in\\kappa\\;(\\vec X_2(i)=2\\land\\vec\\tau_2(i)=\\mathcal P(2))\\\\\n&\\hspace{11em}\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S(\\kappa,\\vec X_2,\\vec\\tau_2,2^\\kappa,\\tau_2)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11ContinuousImageSet}_S(X,f,2^\\kappa,\\tau_2,X,\\tau)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1604,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3727","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-topo9-dyadic-compactum.md|58-df-zfc-topo9-dyadic-compactum]]（batch14）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","3639c3f839b6c954","31e075a848427dc9","5260a5349d0b732f","5fb1c2241d1943d1"]}